  title: 'Saving Face and Avoiding Confrontation - 20th Century '
  info: "Influenced by Asian cultural values, Singaporeans prioritize maintaining
    harmony by avoiding direct confrontation or public embarrassment. This concept
    of \u201Csaving face\u201D is seen in social interactions, where diplomacy and
    indirect communication are preferred over open disputes.  "
